@startuml
title Orchestrated Multilingual Email Workflow

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "Query and recipients" as Input
rectangle "Response agent" as ResponseAgent
rectangle "Coordinator" as Coordinator
rectangle "Translator agent (language A)" as TranslatorA
rectangle "Translator agent (language B)" as TranslatorB
rectangle "Translator agent (language N)" as TranslatorN
rectangle "Email agent" as EmailAgent
rectangle "Issued emails" as Output

Input --> ResponseAgent
ResponseAgent --> Coordinator : source response

Coordinator --> TranslatorA : source response
Coordinator --> TranslatorB : source response
Coordinator --> TranslatorN : source response

TranslatorA --> EmailAgent : translation A
TranslatorB --> EmailAgent : translation B
TranslatorN --> EmailAgent : translation N
Coordinator --> EmailAgent : recipient envelopes
EmailAgent --> Output

note bottom of TranslatorB
  Translation branches run in parallel.
end note
@enduml
